	(text "6 x 74HC165 cascade = 48 bits.  CP=HC_CP(GP2)  PL=HC_PL(GP6)  QH=HC_QH(GP4/MISO).  bits 0..15 encoders A/B, 16..23 encoder push, 24..27 shoulder, 28..47 reserved(GND)."
