	(text "9 x WS2812B-2020 (8 knob rings + status) from +5V. GP7 (3V3) -> U7 74HCT1G125 (VCC = +5V, TTL input) -> R300 330R -> LED_IN ... LED_OUT -> deck chain. Chain current is limited by firmware brightness (spec/40). DECK_ID/DECK_INT: see notes at J-DECK/J-CORE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
