	(text "J-DECK IDC-16 pinout = spec/20-electronics.md 6.2 (odd pins = signal, even = GND). SL1/SL2 get the 1k/100n RC on PANEL-1 before the MCP3208 (CH0/CH1), FSR -> CH6, DECK_ID -> GP27, DECK_INT -> GP28 (spec/20 2: GP28 = DECK_INT, GATE1 = GP22, GATE2 = GP26)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
